"test0" README
==============

Source: node.c errexit.c

Desc:	test the return of negative (invalid) value with different setting

Invoke:	load [0] node.rx [/cfs/ctape0 [TEST01]]

Note:	* use 1 scratch tape
	* log is on "test0.SLr0"
	* result is on "test0.SRr0"
	* tape will be unloaded after the test

Algo:	* negative testing of tdsopen parms
	* write with ds not open
	* tdsclose with ds not open
	* open 2 ds for write on same tape
	* tapedealloc with tape not allocated

